# DESK50 run A -- no window at boot (NEWDESK.INF #W paths empty).
# Double-click the C drive icon (obj 9 at (0,19) 76x40, pass 0) -> do_dopen
# from an icon; then Alt+C -> do_dopen(-'C') -> obj_get_obid.
# IKBD: Alt 38/B8, C 2E/AE (kernel/src/keymap.rs US_NORM 0x2E -> 'c').
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 38 30
800 down
803 up
808 down
811 up
2200 mark A_OPENED
2400 move 600 300
2500 key 38
2520 key 2E
2540 key AE
2560 key B8
4000 mark A_ALTC
